`BIDSDataset` records in `meta["units"]` the unit of each channel type in the data, for example `{"eeg": "V"}` or `{"mag": "T", "grad": "T/m"}`. It stored the `units` argument as given, so a load without `units`, which MNE returns in SI units, said `None`. With `units` set, the record is `{<channel type>: units}`; MNE accepts a string only for data with one channel type that has a unit.
